247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 211 0 R
/E (Today, citizens have no easy, multilingual, or multimedia-based way to report local issues like potholes, garbage, and broken streetlights. On the governance side, complaints remain siloed across departments with no AI-based routing, no analytics, and no accountability loop. Adding to this, existing CCTV infrastructure remains entirely passive, capable of recording but unable to automatically detect accidents or trigger real-time alerts to authorities.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
