/Title (We selected the Shinrai, a Crowdsource Civic Issue Reporting System to address common civic problems such as potholes, broken roads, poor drainage, and waterlogging that frequently affect public safety and daily life. This project leverages AI technologies like NLP and Deep Learning along with a full-stack platform to allow citizens to report issues in real time. The system automatically categorizes complaints and forwards them to the relevant authorities for faster resolution. By enabling timely action, this solution can help reduce accidents, improve infrastructure, promote citizen participation, and support data-driven governance. The goal is to build a scalable system that solves real-world problems and positively impacts society at a large scale.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1686 0 R
>>
